content:
THOSE, that remain'd, grown temp'rate,
Not how to spend, but how to live,
And, when they paid their Tavern Score;
Resolv'd to enter. it no more:
No Vintners Jilt in all the Hive
Could wear now Cloth of Gold and thriv
Nor Torcol such vault Sums advance,
For Bugundy and Ortelans ;
The Courtier's gone, that with his Miss
Supp'd at his House on Christmast Peas;
